WEBVTT

00:00:01.870 --> 00:00:04.500
What about the form of the duel, or our opponent?

00:00:06.410 --> 00:00:09.000
Very well. I'll leave the preparations to you.

00:00:16.450 --> 00:00:17.910
Master Ryuuou?

00:00:18.620 --> 00:00:20.700
The Crazy Person.

00:00:21.160 --> 00:00:25.040
I don't know who he is, but he went through
the trouble of sending me this letter.

00:00:22.490 --> 00:00:25.500
I WANT TO STAKE
EVERYTHING I HAVE
ON AN SCM DUEL WITH YOU.
BECAUSE I'M SO CRAZY,
I DON'T CARE IF WE PLAY
A GAME WHERE I KNOW
I'LL LOSE.

00:00:25.700 --> 00:00:28.830
He says he wants to bet everything on a duel.

00:00:30.370 --> 00:00:33.040
The next duel is going to be a big one.

00:00:33.540 --> 00:00:35.540
Let's give him a warm welcome, shall we?

00:00:40.830 --> 00:00:42.910
I loved holding hands.

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:47.950
But I couldn't hold hands
with my mom and dad anymore.

00:00:49.500 --> 00:00:51.830
People tried to get me to hold their hand.

00:00:52.660 --> 00:00:55.000
They used money. They used violence.

00:00:55.660 --> 00:00:59.450
But nobody was serious about holding my hand.

00:01:00.540 --> 00:01:03.790
Just when I had given up on it altogether...

00:01:08.200 --> 00:01:10.120
I found Seiya.

00:01:11.540 --> 00:01:15.540
He was always by my side.

00:01:17.120 --> 00:01:21.870
I thought he'd always hold my hand.

00:01:22.830 --> 00:01:24.290
But suddenly...

00:01:24.830 --> 00:01:25.910
Why?!

00:01:25.910 --> 00:01:27.500
I don't wanna break up with you!

00:01:27.660 --> 00:01:30.080
If I did something wrong, I'll make it right!

00:01:32.830 --> 00:01:34.370
Seiya!

00:01:36.450 --> 00:01:39.250
I'm sorry, I'm sorry!

00:01:39.250 --> 00:01:40.580
I'm sorry!

00:01:41.870 --> 00:01:44.450
Seiya, why?

00:01:51.840 --> 00:01:53.900
Manga
Cafe
Manga Cafe

00:01:54.540 --> 00:01:57.040
What am I going to do now?

00:01:57.370 --> 00:01:59.200
C'mon now, Julie, sweetie!

00:01:59.370 --> 00:02:02.200
A young woman like yourself
shouldn't be living at an internet café!

00:02:03.290 --> 00:02:05.700
Look, one of my friends says she'll lend you a room!

00:02:05.950 --> 00:02:09.370
Go hit her up, alright?

00:02:10.250 --> 00:02:11.370
Uh-huh...

00:02:12.440 --> 00:02:15.200
EDOGAWA

00:02:13.000 --> 00:02:14.700
Edogawa...

00:02:16.620 --> 00:02:17.700
Is this the place?

00:02:28.620 --> 00:02:29.950
Excuse me?

00:02:31.370 --> 00:02:32.620
Hello?

00:02:34.580 --> 00:02:38.290
It's Julia Katsushika,
I'm going to be living here from now on...

00:02:39.500 --> 00:02:43.660
Umm, is anyone home?

00:02:52.200 --> 00:02:53.200
Hello?

00:02:57.620 --> 00:02:58.660
Hey.

00:02:59.660 --> 00:03:00.830
Who're you?

00:03:01.540 --> 00:03:05.250
Uh, umm, I'm...

00:03:07.150 --> 00:03:12.200
Julia
Katsushika

00:03:07.910 --> 00:03:10.870
I'm Julia Katsushika.

00:03:11.830 --> 00:03:22.120
I want a heart that can laugh without lying

00:03:27.580 --> 00:03:33.790
If I hadn't wanted anything from the start

00:03:35.080 --> 00:03:41.500
Maybe my heart wouldn't have sank so low

00:03:42.250 --> 00:03:50.410
I know the joy of being loved

00:03:50.410 --> 00:03:59.000
But it's not enough, it won't fill me up, it won't purge my fears

00:04:00.950 --> 00:04:04.950
Won't you wet my bone-dry heart?

00:04:04.950 --> 00:04:08.750
Pour the oil over it till it's overflowing

00:04:08.750 --> 00:04:14.290
My scream echoes out in vain

00:04:16.540 --> 00:04:20.500
I want to feel that this boring everyday life

00:04:20.500 --> 00:04:24.160
Is a blessing bestowed upon me

00:04:24.160 --> 00:04:36.660
I want a heart that can laugh without lying

00:04:43.340 --> 00:04:47.250
-servitude-

00:04:43.640 --> 00:04:47.100
The barkeep introduced me to one of her friends,

00:04:47.640 --> 00:04:52.100
a woman named Edogawa, who lived alone with her son.

00:04:52.760 --> 00:04:56.890
She was always working, so she was rarely home.

00:04:57.300 --> 00:05:02.100
The barely-lived-in house felt cold and impersonal.

00:05:03.850 --> 00:05:05.930
Ryuuou-kun! Good morning!

00:05:05.930 --> 00:05:09.640
Oh, it's nighttime, so good evening, I guess.

00:05:15.680 --> 00:05:17.970
Does he not like me?

00:05:19.260 --> 00:05:24.760
Well, I AM freeloading here,
so I've at least got to watch after Ryuuou-kun!

00:05:29.300 --> 00:05:31.930
Ryuuou-kun? Can I come in?

00:05:35.970 --> 00:05:37.510
Ryuuou-kun?

00:05:38.800 --> 00:05:41.640
Hey, I'd like to talk to you about something...

00:05:42.850 --> 00:05:44.140
Can I...?

00:05:51.300 --> 00:05:56.970
Oh, are you studying history?
This is for Egyptian mummies, right?

00:05:57.510 --> 00:05:58.890
It's an iron maiden.

00:05:59.010 --> 00:06:00.970
It's an infamous torture device.

00:06:01.180 --> 00:06:02.850
Torture?

00:06:03.930 --> 00:06:04.970
That's scary!

00:06:05.890 --> 00:06:09.510
Is this all he looks at on the internet?

00:06:14.470 --> 00:06:15.350
What?

00:06:16.180 --> 00:06:18.680
Do you know how to play the Counting Game?

00:06:18.680 --> 00:06:20.220
Counting Game?

00:06:21.640 --> 00:06:23.930
No, how do you play?

00:06:24.640 --> 00:06:29.430
Two people take turns counting from one to twenty.

00:06:30.220 --> 00:06:32.430
Each person can say up to three numbers.

00:06:32.970 --> 00:06:35.050
The person who says twenty loses.

00:06:35.180 --> 00:06:38.760
Wow. So you can say three numbers...

00:06:38.760 --> 00:06:40.760
One, two three...

00:06:40.760 --> 00:06:42.470
Four, five...

00:06:43.470 --> 00:06:44.470
Let's give it a try.

00:06:44.760 --> 00:06:46.260
Okay!

00:06:46.260 --> 00:06:48.260
Put this in your mouth, then.

00:06:49.890 --> 00:06:51.640
What is this?

00:06:51.930 --> 00:06:54.010
It's a device that shocks you if you lose.

00:06:54.890 --> 00:06:56.390
Shocks?

00:06:57.100 --> 00:07:00.760
But this is my chance
to get to be friends with Ryuuou-kun!

00:07:01.760 --> 00:07:03.890
Okay, let's start the game.

00:07:04.180 --> 00:07:05.760
What are we playing again?

00:07:05.760 --> 00:07:08.140
Umm, the Counting Game...

00:07:10.010 --> 00:07:11.760
It just clicked!

00:07:11.890 --> 00:07:13.600
That means the game's started.

00:07:13.600 --> 00:07:15.260
Can I go first?

00:07:16.050 --> 00:07:16.850
Sure.

00:07:17.800 --> 00:07:18.850
Okay, here we go.

00:07:19.760 --> 00:07:20.350
One.

00:07:20.850 --> 00:07:23.350
Umm, two, three.

00:07:23.680 --> 00:07:25.350
Four, five.

00:07:25.800 --> 00:07:28.850
Okay then... six, seven, eight.

00:07:29.100 --> 00:07:31.350
Nine, ten, eleven.

00:07:31.600 --> 00:07:34.350
Twelve, thirteen... fourteen.

00:07:35.550 --> 00:07:37.850
Fifteen. I win.

00:07:38.140 --> 00:07:40.890
Huh? But you said the game goes until twenty.

00:07:41.350 --> 00:07:44.510
Count out the possibilities in your head.

00:07:44.850 --> 00:07:46.850
They all end with you losing.

00:07:50.140 --> 00:07:53.180
You're right, I lose...

00:07:58.930 --> 00:08:01.850
There's a trick to this game.

00:08:02.300 --> 00:08:10.600
You can win if you get nineteen, fifteen,
eleven, seven, or three.

00:08:10.970 --> 00:08:13.350
You'll win if your opponent doesn't know the trick.

00:08:13.350 --> 00:08:16.140
It's a variation of a game called Nim.

00:08:16.800 --> 00:08:18.720
But that's not important right now.

00:08:21.050 --> 00:08:23.640
Hey. Strip for me.

00:08:23.890 --> 00:08:24.390
What?

00:08:25.100 --> 00:08:26.640
Take off your clothes.

00:08:32.100 --> 00:08:34.680
Why am I...

00:08:48.800 --> 00:08:51.100
You actually obeyed my command...

00:08:52.760 --> 00:08:54.550
This SCM is real.

00:08:55.300 --> 00:08:56.760
"Essie em"?

00:08:57.430 --> 00:09:02.010
Yes. By using it, I've made you my slave.

00:09:02.550 --> 00:09:04.010
Slave?

00:09:08.970 --> 00:09:10.680
Here's your next order.

00:09:11.720 --> 00:09:13.970
You're going to take me somewhere I want to go.

00:09:16.140 --> 00:09:18.300
You wanted to go...

00:09:18.300 --> 00:09:19.180
MASSAGE PARLOR
GALAXY MAGNUM

00:09:19.180 --> 00:09:19.890
Maneater Health Club
Savanna

00:09:19.220 --> 00:09:21.430
...here? Really?

00:09:21.300 --> 00:09:23.850
Snack bar
JE T'AIME

00:09:25.760 --> 00:09:29.010
Ryuuou-kun! You can't! Wait!

00:09:29.010 --> 00:09:29.600
Hey!

00:09:31.010 --> 00:09:34.260
What're you doing?! This is no place for a rotten kid!

00:09:34.260 --> 00:09:35.760
Maneater Health Club
Savanna

00:09:36.720 --> 00:09:40.010
Let go of me! Mom!

00:09:40.850 --> 00:09:42.260
What's all the commotion?

00:09:42.760 --> 00:09:43.890
Boss!

00:09:43.890 --> 00:09:46.760
Sorry, this kid just ran in here...

00:09:48.600 --> 00:09:49.760
Hmmm.

00:09:50.600 --> 00:09:53.260
Came to rescue your mother, did you?

00:09:54.800 --> 00:09:56.720
You've got good eyes on you.

00:09:57.350 --> 00:10:00.760
You're the kind of kid who'll do anything
to achieve his goals.

00:10:01.180 --> 00:10:06.510
Unfortunately, your mommy owes me a lot of money.

00:10:06.930 --> 00:10:09.800
She can't quit her job here just yet.

00:10:11.760 --> 00:10:12.550
How much is it?

00:10:13.180 --> 00:10:15.680
How much do I have to pay you to free her?

00:10:15.970 --> 00:10:17.680
Let me see...

00:10:21.010 --> 00:10:24.180
Pay me a hundred million yen and I'll think about it.

00:10:25.970 --> 00:10:27.760
You his big sister?

00:10:27.760 --> 00:10:28.930
Oh, no...

00:10:29.600 --> 00:10:33.300
You could earn a boatload of money
working at one of our shops.

00:10:33.300 --> 00:10:34.680
Ah, umm...

00:10:36.260 --> 00:10:39.140
We didn't get Ryuuou-kun's mother back.

00:10:40.050 --> 00:10:43.800
But a hundred million yen is just impossible...

00:10:53.850 --> 00:10:55.510
Ryuuou-kun...

00:11:02.010 --> 00:11:03.140
Don't touch me!

00:11:21.680 --> 00:11:23.180
It's okay.

00:11:28.300 --> 00:11:33.970
It's okay. I'm right here.

00:11:38.720 --> 00:11:41.510
It's not that I need someone to hold my hand.

00:11:42.510 --> 00:11:44.970
I need to make sure I don't let go of theirs.

00:11:51.220 --> 00:11:54.890
Julia, obey my orders.

00:12:01.720 --> 00:12:03.010
This is bait.

00:12:04.220 --> 00:12:09.550
Toss the bait into the water,
and the people we catch will bring me SCMs.

00:12:11.050 --> 00:12:14.720
Then I'll make all of them my slaves!

00:12:17.510 --> 00:12:22.260
I'll squeeze the money out of my slaves, every last drop...

00:12:23.760 --> 00:12:25.220
Okay.

00:12:28.260 --> 00:12:30.430
I'll help you.

00:12:31.890 --> 00:12:33.220
Ryuuou-kun...

00:12:33.510 --> 00:12:37.050
No, Master Ryuuou...

00:12:37.390 --> 00:12:39.800
I'll help you get lots of slaves.

00:12:42.800 --> 00:12:44.220
You're so weird.

00:12:46.050 --> 00:12:52.180
After that, Master Ryuuou and I
snatched up slaves one by one.

00:12:58.800 --> 00:12:59.970
But...

00:13:00.100 --> 00:13:05.180
Nobody here knows Master Ryuuou's true motives.

00:13:06.100 --> 00:13:11.140
That's a secret only he and I share.

00:13:13.140 --> 00:13:14.890
I WANT TO STAKE
EVERYTHING I HAVE
ON AN SCM DUEL WITH YOU.
BECAUSE I'M SO CRAZY,
I DON'T CARE IF WE PLAY
A GAME WHERE I KNOW
I'LL LOSE.

00:13:15.970 --> 00:13:19.930
I would do anything for Master Ryuuou.

00:13:20.890 --> 00:13:23.390
This is proof.

00:13:24.600 --> 00:13:29.140
Master Ryuuou and I have something special.

00:13:41.850 --> 00:13:47.470
First, let me thank you for so graciously inviting me here.

00:13:47.800 --> 00:13:50.800
You the so-called "Crazy Person"?

00:13:51.010 --> 00:13:54.350
Indeed. I am Fujiko Taito.

00:13:55.300 --> 00:13:56.300
And you are...?

00:13:57.140 --> 00:13:58.550
I'm Ryuuou.

00:13:58.760 --> 00:14:01.050
My, aren't you cute?

00:14:01.890 --> 00:14:04.850
I'm so glad you've come to play with me.

00:14:06.140 --> 00:14:07.930
Let me confirm the rules of this duel.

00:14:09.140 --> 00:14:11.430
The duel will take place in this warehouse.

00:14:12.140 --> 00:14:18.220
Each team consists of a master and four slaves
in a five-on-five team battle.

00:14:18.550 --> 00:14:20.760
The game will be Capture the Flag.

00:14:20.890 --> 00:14:27.890
The team that captures the other team's flag,
each posted on one end of the warehouse, wins.

00:14:29.390 --> 00:14:33.970
The master gives their slaves orders
to steal the other flag while protecting their own.

00:14:34.220 --> 00:14:38.220
Injuring your opponent's slaves is, of course, allowed.

00:14:38.640 --> 00:14:40.760
If a participant touches the ground with any body part
other than their feet or legs,

00:14:40.890 --> 00:14:42.140
they are immediately removed from play.

00:14:42.470 --> 00:14:44.430
This includes falling or being tripped.

00:14:45.890 --> 00:14:50.470
The players can focus on removing the opponent's
players from play, or simply go for the flag.

00:14:51.010 --> 00:14:54.430
Losing players does not affect the outcome of the game.

00:14:55.010 --> 00:14:58.260
Those are the rules. Any questions?

00:14:58.390 --> 00:14:59.140
No.

00:14:59.140 --> 00:15:01.680
No changes to what was previously proposed, I see.

00:15:02.800 --> 00:15:06.260
The players of the losing team
will become slaves to the winner.

00:15:06.720 --> 00:15:07.680
That's correct.

00:15:08.600 --> 00:15:11.260
The game will start in ten minutes.

00:15:13.970 --> 00:15:15.260
Let's start...

00:15:15.390 --> 00:15:16.760
...the duel!

00:15:23.390 --> 00:15:27.930
If I can win this duel, I can get all of Ryuuou's slaves.

00:15:28.050 --> 00:15:31.100
He's probably the largest faction out there...

00:15:31.640 --> 00:15:34.350
They'll be the perfect gifts for you!

00:15:34.510 --> 00:15:38.550
Ahh, my beloved Shinnosuke-sama...

00:15:39.010 --> 00:15:41.850
Your slave of love is coming for you!

00:15:45.350 --> 00:15:49.680
To get the flag, we'll have to go into enemy territory.

00:15:50.300 --> 00:15:52.220
There are three routes to get there.

00:15:52.510 --> 00:15:55.350
The paths on either side are the quickest routes.

00:15:55.470 --> 00:15:58.850
I'll rush straight into an attack right from the start!

00:16:00.930 --> 00:16:01.930
Forward!

00:16:03.640 --> 00:16:06.930
I've got a musclehead and a fat guy on my side.

00:16:07.930 --> 00:16:10.180
I should have more than enough power to break through!

00:16:17.050 --> 00:16:19.140
Hey, found one!

00:16:19.680 --> 00:16:21.470
Up against one person? Be careful.

00:16:21.470 --> 00:16:23.760
Hah! Won't be a problem!

00:16:32.220 --> 00:16:34.300
I got you, you moron!

00:16:35.680 --> 00:16:36.890
Oil?!

00:16:36.890 --> 00:16:39.600
You really are a moron. It was obviously a trap.

00:16:41.680 --> 00:16:43.300
Later, loser!

00:16:51.600 --> 00:16:53.260
That was close!

00:16:53.260 --> 00:16:56.100
Be careful! What if I'd died?!

00:16:56.600 --> 00:16:59.470
I don't know, it'd probably just end up labeled
an unfortunate accident.

00:16:59.600 --> 00:17:01.720
How are things going for you, Meguro-san?

00:17:01.970 --> 00:17:03.800
I got nothing right now...

00:17:08.300 --> 00:17:11.050
It's okay, I'm here. Don't be afraid.

00:17:11.800 --> 00:17:14.220
You disgust me, so could you please not speak to me?

00:17:17.510 --> 00:17:18.050
Seiya?!

00:17:18.760 --> 00:17:20.050
Ayaka...

00:17:21.050 --> 00:17:22.930
I'm sorry, Seiya!

00:17:23.680 --> 00:17:24.010
Wha-, hey, stop...

00:17:24.010 --> 00:17:25.220
Go!

00:17:28.180 --> 00:17:30.600
Dammit, stay back!

00:17:36.760 --> 00:17:38.640
Why're you resisting, Ayaka?!

00:17:38.850 --> 00:17:41.100
I can't help it; I have to follow orders!

00:17:41.100 --> 00:17:43.430
Why don't YOU move, Seiya?!

00:17:43.430 --> 00:17:44.970
No, YOU move!

00:17:44.970 --> 00:17:45.430
What?!

00:17:45.720 --> 00:17:49.390
What's the hold-up, Meguro-san?!
Get through there already!

00:17:51.220 --> 00:17:52.970
God dammit!

00:17:55.970 --> 00:17:57.100
Shit!

00:17:58.890 --> 00:18:00.180
Alright!

00:18:03.600 --> 00:18:04.970
Can you not?

00:18:06.510 --> 00:18:09.050
Now the other team only has two members...

00:18:09.260 --> 00:18:11.050
Where are they hiding?

00:18:12.220 --> 00:18:15.470
Lucie-san, find the remaining members.

00:18:15.470 --> 00:18:16.300
Yes, ma'am.

00:18:16.600 --> 00:18:18.890
What move will you make, Ryuuou?

00:18:22.220 --> 00:18:23.760
Ryuuou's gone?

00:18:23.930 --> 00:18:26.260
Meguro-san, hurry forward!

00:18:27.300 --> 00:18:30.800
I don't know where he is, but we'll get the flag first!

00:18:37.100 --> 00:18:38.010
A trap...

00:18:41.390 --> 00:18:44.970
That's right. Our territory is protected by traps.

00:18:45.760 --> 00:18:47.100
Now's our chance!

00:18:48.640 --> 00:18:50.010
A fucking bear trap?

00:18:50.010 --> 00:18:51.010
Are you serious?

00:18:54.970 --> 00:18:58.010
Spotted someone on the enemy team. A woman.

00:18:58.640 --> 00:19:01.680
I can see her from here! I don't see anyone else!

00:19:02.180 --> 00:19:04.140
Okay, we've got this.

00:19:04.430 --> 00:19:07.510
Meguro-san! Go forth and attack!

00:19:07.850 --> 00:19:08.510
Okay!

00:19:18.010 --> 00:19:20.140
The woman fell over all of a sudden!

00:19:20.430 --> 00:19:21.510
She got shocked!

00:19:21.510 --> 00:19:22.180
What?

00:19:22.510 --> 00:19:25.550
The enemy territory is flooded with water!

00:19:25.800 --> 00:19:29.550
Don't tell me they're running a current
through their territory to protect it...

00:19:30.550 --> 00:19:34.300
They sacrificed one of their own players
to warn us about approaching?

00:19:34.890 --> 00:19:36.890
No, he's bluffing!

00:19:36.890 --> 00:19:38.800
Keep going and grab that flag!

00:19:38.930 --> 00:19:43.470
W-we can't. If we move forward, we'll get shocked...

00:19:45.050 --> 00:19:48.680
Slaves don't have to follow orders
that might put their lives in danger...

00:19:48.680 --> 00:19:49.850
Found him!

00:19:50.100 --> 00:19:52.760
The other team is getting close to you!

00:19:54.800 --> 00:19:56.470
You sure planned this out well.

00:19:57.140 --> 00:19:59.550
Did you sneak in here before to set all this up?

00:20:02.720 --> 00:20:04.050
Ryuuou...

00:20:04.430 --> 00:20:06.050
Lucie-san, come back here!

00:20:06.050 --> 00:20:08.050
Huh? I can't jump down from here...

00:20:08.300 --> 00:20:10.890
Do it! Jump down!

00:20:11.100 --> 00:20:12.800
I can't, I just can't!

00:20:12.800 --> 00:20:13.550
Hey, Fujiko.

00:20:14.510 --> 00:20:16.800
You just thought you'd won, didn't you?

00:20:16.970 --> 00:20:21.260
It's pretty ironic that you're losing
the moment you thought you'd won, isn't it?

00:20:24.180 --> 00:20:25.180
This is your punishment.

00:20:26.760 --> 00:20:29.050
You tried to take my slaves from me.

00:20:29.800 --> 00:20:32.800
That's why I wanted to punish you.

00:20:35.510 --> 00:20:37.510
I lose.

00:20:47.970 --> 00:20:49.930
She's awake!

00:20:49.930 --> 00:20:51.720
How are you? Can you move at all?

00:20:51.930 --> 00:20:53.140
Yeah...

00:20:58.970 --> 00:20:59.890
Wow...

00:21:00.550 --> 00:21:02.550
You really did shock yourself.

00:21:03.180 --> 00:21:05.050
That was really dangerous!

00:21:05.050 --> 00:21:08.180
You knew, but you still pressed that switch?

00:21:09.470 --> 00:21:11.850
Master Ryuuou ordered me to.

00:21:13.010 --> 00:21:15.550
Meguro and the others resisted the order...

00:21:16.050 --> 00:21:19.010
Does she not care if she lives or dies?

00:21:19.390 --> 00:21:21.350
She would go that far for her master?

00:21:24.220 --> 00:21:26.260
You're an idiot.

00:21:30.760 --> 00:21:33.930
Looks like a large number of slaves has changed hands.

00:21:35.050 --> 00:21:40.470
Fujiko Taito and her five slaves
have lost to Ryuuou Edogawa.

00:21:41.100 --> 00:21:44.100
Ryuuou now has eleven slaves.

00:21:44.800 --> 00:21:47.970
Not bad for a normal person.

00:21:50.800 --> 00:21:53.800
Hey, Gramps. He's coming.

00:21:56.680 --> 00:21:58.550
Hello there, Nerima-san.

00:21:59.220 --> 00:22:02.550
How's business going?

00:22:17.430 --> 00:22:21.050
-servitude-

00:22:23.010 --> 00:22:27.760
The ultimate game is testing my heart

00:22:27.760 --> 00:22:32.550
A strategy that starts from a one-on-one

00:22:32.550 --> 00:22:35.220
It's getting close, do I attack or pull back

00:22:35.220 --> 00:22:37.010
Play defense or offense on the brink?

00:22:37.010 --> 00:22:40.140
Tell me, which is better?

00:22:40.140 --> 00:22:44.390
I don't care if the rules leave me without a chance

00:22:44.390 --> 00:22:50.600
I have one last chance in my hand for my unclear future

00:22:50.600 --> 00:22:55.760
Does the deck in front of me shine light on that future?

00:22:56.430 --> 00:23:05.350
Examining your visible and hidden expression, my fate concealed

00:23:05.350 --> 00:23:10.510
Drawing forth luck, I don't want to lose

00:23:10.510 --> 00:23:14.260
I can't evolve if I keep saying "I can't"

00:23:14.260 --> 00:23:18.890
I'll win my game with you

00:23:19.010 --> 00:23:26.720
And overcome all barriers, so I never go bust again

00:23:36.510 --> 00:23:41.510
-discovery-
